{"id":"n88250-1-9","stage":5,"title":"힐끗 · 瞟着","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88250-1-9-1","ko":"요 앞에 새로 생긴 가게에 들어가 봤니?","zh":"你进去过前面新开的那个店吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"요：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"요","audio":"/audio/d525e7107305db853261.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67862","senseId":"2","lemma":"요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요","audio":"/audio/d525e7107305db853261.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에","audio":"/audio/6ee410c0325daaa6155d.mp3"}},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"생긴","meaning":"有，出现","explanation":"생기다：有，出现；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"1","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생긴","audio":"/audio/6a1f8f2f14401a79cbc7.mp3"}},{"text":"가게에","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가게에","audio":"/audio/dcd7d2a0ec316502a2f3.mp3"}},{"text":"들어가","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어가","audio":"/audio/cb9553bc72d628601950.mp3"}},{"text":"봤니?","meaning":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤니","audio":"/audio/f1501c6cd4fb2c2f0d42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d525e7107305db85","term":"요","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/d525e7107305db853261.mp3","entryId":"67862","definition":"(贬称)(昵称)用于指示刚才所说的对象。","pronunciation":["요"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"有，出现","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"新增了原本没有的东西。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进，进去","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"由外往里去。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4ac6e2f3f17ce7aa475f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88250-1-9-2","ko":"아니. 지나가면서 힐끗 보기만 했어.","zh":"没有。只是路过时顺眼瞥了一眼而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니.","meaning":"不是，不用，不要","explanation":"아니：不是，不用，不要","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65982","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"지나가면서","meaning":"通过，路过","explanation":"지나가다：通过，路过；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"지나가다","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60216","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지나가면서","audio":"/audio/4229f9a4d9e3c2568b14.mp3"}},{"text":"힐끗","meaning":"瞟着","explanation":"힐끗：瞟着","readings":[{"term":"힐끗","audio":"/audio/f7b09de03b10af78444d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88250","senseId":"1","lemma":"힐끗","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힐끗","audio":"/audio/f7b09de03b10af78444d.mp3"}},{"text":"보기만","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보기만","audio":"/audio/201aef5f0306df13391c.mp3"}},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","explanation":"하다：表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"32","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어","audio":"/audio/76f3569b074c48dd5200.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不是，不用，不要","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65982","definition":"用于否定回答晚辈或年龄、地位等相等的人所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"9c25392f9bf0bb82","term":"지나가다","zh":"通过，路过","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3","entryId":"60216","definition":"经过某个地方。","pronunciation":["지나가다"]},{"id":"f7b09de03b10af78","term":"힐끗","zh":"瞟着","audio":"/audio/f7b09de03b10af78444d.mp3","entryId":"88250","definition":"斜着眼睛悄悄看一次的样子。","pronunciation":["힐끋"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示“但是”、“因为那样”、“那么”、“因此”、“所以”的意思。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1eaf1df69b4800cc2327.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.262,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88250","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":156,"sequenceScore":3.0887,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["没有。只是路过时顺眼瞥了一眼而已。","你进去过前面新开的那个店吗？","最近哪怕只走一点路，也会喘不过气来。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你进去过前面新开的那个店吗？","最近哪怕只走一点路，也会喘不过气来。","没有。只是路过时顺眼瞥了一眼而已。"],"answer":2}]}
